WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Inheritance always runs Default, then Product, then Variation. The most specific intentional value wins.

2
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Use inherited setting means keep the value from the level above. This is the safest everyday choice.

3
00:00:40.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Set a different value here replaces the inherited scalar for this product or variation only.

4
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Turn off means intentionally none for this item where the field supports it. It is not the same as forgetting to configure.

5
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:40.000
For delivery offers, you may add, remove, or replace inherited options depending on the controls your screen shows. Empty lists are not always inherit — read the labels carefully.
